  - m_Id: 410822712418304
    m_Localized: ANTHONY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527168
    m_Localized: KEVIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527169
    m_Localized: PETER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527170
    m_Localized: GEORGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527171
    m_Localized: MICHAEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527172
    m_Localized: CHARLES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527173
    m_Localized: FRED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527174
    m_Localized: DAVIDE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527175
    m_Localized: MARY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527176
    m_Localized: MARTHA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527177
    m_Localized: CHARLOTTE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527178
    m_Localized: OLIVIA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527179
    m_Localized: AVA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527180
    m_Localized: EMMA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527181
    m_Localized: ISABELLA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527182
    m_Localized: LUNA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527183
    m_Localized: Do you really believe this? What a shame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721472
    m_Localized: This makes no sense. Have you even read it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721473
    m_Localized: Don't send me this things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721474
    m_Localized: I'm keen to know when are you gonna send something useful. This
      makes no sense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721475
    m_Localized: I find this article to be specially interesting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721476
    m_Localized: Thank you for sharing the article, it's better to know about this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721477
    m_Localized: Super interesting! You're always watching out for good information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721478
    m_Localized: Thank your for sending this, I had no idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721479
    m_Localized: Hello! This message would be a reaction to the article you just
      sent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721480
    m_Localized: I am an acquaintance of yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721481
    m_Localized: In fact, I do not exist and I have nothing to do with anyone you
      know in real life with my name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721482
    m_Localized: Good morning! I am another of your acquaintances.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721483
    m_Localized: In this chat we'll be telling you what your articles makes us feel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721484
    m_Localized: For now, we'll be going back to the page you were on before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721485
    m_Localized: To do that, I need you to press the button in the top right of the
      screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721486
    m_Localized: Try it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721487
    m_Localized: Welcome to Level Up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721488
    m_Localized: In this section, we will give you INSTRUCTIONS on how to play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721489
    m_Localized: We will show you the Articles section. There you can find out the
      latest news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721490
    m_Localized: Here you can see multiple newspaper articles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721491
    m_Localized: You can see the title and a related image.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721492
    m_Localized: Also, using your finger, you can move around this screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721493
    m_Localized: If you swipe up, you will see more items at the bottom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721494
    m_Localized: If you swipe down, you will return to the previous articles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721495
    m_Localized: Try it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721496
    m_Localized: Now we will show you the buttons for the items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721497
    m_Localized: You can't click on them yet, but we'll gradually show them to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721498
    m_Localized: "The first one is at the top right, the \u201CSkip\u201D button."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721499
    m_Localized: By clicking this button, you are telling us that you are NOT interested
      in this item, so it will disappear from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721500
    m_Localized: Try pressing it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721501
    m_Localized: "The next button is \u201CREAD.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721502
    m_Localized: By clicking this button, you will see more information about the
      item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721503
    m_Localized: You can read it to find out exactly what it says and where it gets
      its information from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721504
    m_Localized: Try it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721505
    m_Localized: Great!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721506
    m_Localized: Now that you've read the article, you know what it's really about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721507
    m_Localized: We will then try to share it with your close groups.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721508
    m_Localized: These groups are NOT REAL.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721509
    m_Localized: They are part of the game, where we try to simulate the use of social
      networks such as WhatsApp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721510
    m_Localized: "The third and final button available is \u201CShare.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721511
    m_Localized: With this button, you will be able to share articles that you find
      relevant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915776
    m_Localized: It is important that you share those that impact you or interest
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915777
    m_Localized: "To do this, you have to press the \u201CShare\u201D button indicated."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915778
    m_Localized: Try it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915779
    m_Localized: Great! You're already doing great.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915780
    m_Localized: 'You have seen the different features we have available:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915781
    m_Localized: READ articles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915782
    m_Localized: SKIP articles that do NOT interest you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915783
    m_Localized: and SHARE the articles with your close circles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915784
    m_Localized: Before we go, let's review the buttons for a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915785
    m_Localized: "Once you have selected the correct one, the \u201CNEXT\u201D button
      below will become active again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915786
    m_Localized: Press the button to SKIP items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915787
    m_Localized: Great job!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915788
    m_Localized: Now press the button to READ articles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915789
    m_Localized: Great! Now the last one...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915790
    m_Localized: Click the share articles button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915791
    m_Localized: Perfect! It seems like you have everything figured out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915792
    m_Localized: We'll leave you to the game now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915793
    m_Localized: Remember, you can report any technical problems.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822787915794
    m_Localized: Enjoy yourself!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618628841472
    m_Localized: SOURCE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978816
    m_Localized: NEXT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978817
    m_Localized: This is the body of the article. This is where you can read all
      the important information about the news story. It is very important that you
      read it, because it can clarify much of what the headline tells us, preventing
      us from falling for falsehoods so easily. Thank you for reading!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978818
    m_Localized: This is the article's Title.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416448
    m_Localized: FAMILY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416449
    m_Localized: FRIENDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416450
    m_Localized: NEIGHBOURS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 427584111697920
    m_Localized: Have you seen this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
